<FIELD ID="healpix_" datatype="double" name="healpix_">
<DESCRIPTION>Healpix number using Nside = 4096 with the nested scheme on equatorial coordinates times 2^35. The last digits of the source_id are reserved for a running number that serves as a unique identifier per HEALPix cell. This is formed in accordance with Gaia's source_id definition, but of course mock objects have no relation to any Gaia objects that may have an identical source_id. -- *TAINTED*: the value was operated on in a way that unit and ucd may be severely wrong</DESCRIPTION>
</FIELD>
<FIELD ID="phot_g_mean_mag_" datatype="double" name="phot_g_mean_mag_" unit="mag*mag">
<DESCRIPTION>This field has traces of: [GeDR3mock only] Monochromatic extinction at lambda = 547.7nm; Median extinction in the Gaia G band for monochromatic extinction (A_0) of 1 mag for the respective isochrone bin -- *TAINTED*: the value was operated on in a way that unit and ucd may be severely wrong</DESCRIPTION>
</FIELD>
<FIELD ID="g_rp_" datatype="double" name="g_rp_" unit="mag*mag">
<DESCRIPTION>This field has traces of: [GeDR3mock only] Monochromatic extinction at lambda = 547.7nm; Median extinction in the Gaia G band for monochromatic extinction (A_0) of 1 mag for the respective isochrone bin; [GeDR3mock only] Monochromatic extinction at lambda = 547.7nm; Median extinction in the Gaia RP band for monochromatic extinction (A_0) of 1 mag for the respective isochrone bin -- *TAINTED*: the value was operated on in a way that unit and ucd may be severely wrong</DESCRIPTION>
</FIELD>
<FIELD ID="n" datatype="int" name="n" ucd="meta.number">
<VALUES null='-2147483648'/>
</FIELD>
